    "title": "WFRP4e Hidden Opposed Rolls",
    "description": "Lets the GM hide their opposed (attack) roll results from players while still delivering the defend/response buttons to the targeted player. WFRP4e posts the roll numbers and the response buttons as separate chat cards; this module keeps the roll card GM-only and re-routes the button card to the target, so hiding your roll no longer hides their defence.",
